note the one .md entry is named rather than swept -- the law line says Kyri only, the room has held that file since 20260725, and a catalog states its exception instead of hiding it
note a seal is the bytes; an entry is the meaning -- two lines rather than one field, because a note carries spaces and a digest appended after free-form prose is a digest nothing can parse
